* Lab 06-10 -- op-amp circuits in ngspice with near-ideal op-amps (E sources, gain 1e8) and, where
* the chapter needs them, finite gain, offset and bias-current sources, and a saturating output.
*
* EXPECT ex1out  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.1b rtol=1e-6
* EXPECT ex2out  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.2a rtol=1e-6
* EXPECT ex3out  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.3a scale=1e-3 rtol=1e-3
* EXPECT ex3cm   key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.3b scale=-1e-3 rtol=1e-3
* EXPECT ex4vos  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.4b scale=1e-3 rtol=1e-5
* EXPECT ex4ibm  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.4c scale=-1e-3 rtol=1e-6
* EXPECT ex4ibp  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.4d scale=1e-3 rtol=1e-6
* EXPECT ex5out  key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.5b scale=1e-3 rtol=1e-3
* EXPECT ex5cm   key:../../chapters/06-10-ideal-op-amp.md#Ex_06-10.5d scale=-1e-3 rtol=2e-3
* EXPECT p1out   key:../../solutions/06-10-solutions.md#06-10.1b rtol=1e-3
* EXPECT p3out   key:../../solutions/06-10-solutions.md#06-10.3a rtol=1e-6
* EXPECT p4out   key:../../solutions/06-10-solutions.md#06-10.4b rtol=1e-3
* EXPECT p9vm    key:../../solutions/06-10-solutions.md#06-10.9c rtol=1e-3
* EXPECT p11gain key:../../solutions/06-10-solutions.md#06-10.11a rtol=1e-4

* ---- Example 06-10.1: inverting, 10k and 47k, 0.5 V in
V1   i1 0 DC 0.5
R11  i1 n1 10k
R12  n1 o1 47k
E1   o1 0 0 n1 1e8
* ---- Example 06-10.2: summing DAC, code 101 (5 V, 0 V, 5 V) into 10k, 20k, 40k; Rf = 10k
V2a  b2a 0 DC 5
V2b  b2b 0 DC 0
V2c  b2c 0 DC 5
R2a  b2a n2 10k
R2b  b2b n2 20k
R2c  b2c n2 40k
R2f  n2 o2 10k
E2   o2 0 0 n2 1e8
* ---- Example 06-10.3: difference amp, G = 100, bridge inputs (1.25 V and 1.25 V + 1.24875 mV)
V3a  v31 0 DC 1.25
V3b  v32 0 DC 1.2512487512
R31  v31 n3 1k
R32  n3 o3 100k
R33  v32 p3 1k
R34  p3 0 100k
E3   o3 0 p3 n3 1e8
* worst corner (R2/R1 high, R4/R3 low) with 1.25 V on both inputs
V3c  v3c 0 DC 1.25
R31w v3c n3w 0.99k
R32w n3w o3w 101k
R33w v3c p3w 1.01k
R34w p3w 0 99k
E3w  o3w 0 p3w n3w 1e8
* ---- Example 06-10.4: gain 101 (1k, 100k) with 10k source resistance; LM358 limits one term at a time
* (a) 7 mV offset in series with the + input, signal 0
V4a  s4a 0 DC 0
R4sa s4a x4a 10k
V4os p4a x4a DC 7m
R41a n4a 0 1k
R42a n4a o4a 100k
E4a  o4a 0 p4a n4a 1e8
* (b) 250 nA flowing out of the - input (PNP input stage)
V4b  s4b 0 DC 0
R4sb s4b p4b 10k
R41b n4b 0 1k
R42b n4b o4b 100k
I4bm 0 n4b DC 250n
E4b  o4b 0 p4b n4b 1e8
* (c) 250 nA flowing out of the + input, through the 10k source resistance
V4c  s4c 0 DC 0
R4sc s4c p4c 10k
R41c n4c 0 1k
R42c n4c o4c 100k
I4cp 0 p4c DC 250n
E4c  o4c 0 p4c n4c 1e8
* ---- Example 06-10.5: three-op-amp in-amp, R = 25k, RG = 500, unity difference stage (nominal and worst corner)
.subckt inamp vp vm out params: ra=10k rb=10k rc=10k rd=10k
Ea  oa 0 vp na 1e8
Eb  ob 0 vm nb 1e8
Rfa na oa 25k
Rfb nb ob 25k
RG  na nb 500
R1  ob n {ra}
R2  n out {rb}
R3  oa p {rc}
R4  p 0 {rd}
Ec  out 0 p n 1e8
.ends
V5p  v5p 0 DC 1.2512487512
V5m  v5m 0 DC 1.25
X5   v5p v5m o5 inamp ra=10k rb=10k rc=10k rd=10k
V5c  v5c 0 DC 1.25
X5w  v5c v5c o5w inamp ra=9.9k rb=10.1k rc=10.1k rd=9.9k
* ---- Problem 06-10.1: inverting, 4.7k and 100k, 0.1 V
V61  i61 0 DC 0.1
R611 i61 n61 4.7k
R612 n61 o61 100k
E61  o61 0 0 n61 1e8
* ---- Problem 06-10.3: summing 1 V, -0.5 V, 2 V into 10k, 20k, 40k; Rf = 20k
V63a a63 0 DC 1
V63b b63 0 DC -0.5
V63c c63 0 DC 2
R63a a63 n63 10k
R63b b63 n63 20k
R63c c63 n63 40k
R63f n63 o63 20k
E63  o63 0 0 n63 1e8
* ---- Problem 06-10.4: difference amp G = 10 with R4 = 101k; v1 = 2.00 V, v2 = 2.05 V
V64a a64 0 DC 2.00
V64b b64 0 DC 2.05
R641 a64 n64 10k
R642 n64 o64 100k
R643 b64 p64 10k
R644 p64 0 101k
E64  o64 0 p64 n64 1e8
* ---- Problem 06-10.9: inverting gain -4.7 with a smoothly saturating output at +/-12 V, 3 V in
V69  i69 0 DC 3
R691 i69 n69 10k
R692 n69 o69 47k
B69  o69 0 V = 12*tanh(1e5*(0 - v(n69))/12)
* ---- Problem 06-10.11: inverting, R2/R1 = 100, A = 1e4
V611 i611 0 DC 1
R6111 i611 n611 1k
R6112 n611 o611 100k
E611 o611 0 0 n611 1e4

.control
op
let ex1out = v(o1)
let ex2out = v(o2)
let ex3out = v(o3)
let ex3cm = v(o3w)
let ex4vos = v(o4a)
let ex4ibm = v(o4b)
let ex4ibp = v(o4c)
let ex5out = v(o5)
let ex5cm = v(o5w)
let p1out = v(o61)
let p3out = v(o63)
let p4out = v(o64)
let p9vm = v(n69)
let p11gain = v(o611)
echo "ex1out = $&ex1out"
echo "ex2out = $&ex2out"
echo "ex3out = $&ex3out"
echo "ex3cm = $&ex3cm"
echo "ex4vos = $&ex4vos"
echo "ex4ibm = $&ex4ibm"
echo "ex4ibp = $&ex4ibp"
echo "ex5out = $&ex5out"
echo "ex5cm = $&ex5cm"
echo "p1out = $&p1out"
echo "p3out = $&p3out"
echo "p4out = $&p4out"
echo "p9vm = $&p9vm"
echo "p11gain = $&p11gain"
.endc
.end
